INESS WIRE)--WELLS FARGO & COMPANY (NYSE: WFC) TODAY ANNOUNCED DIVIDENDS ON 10 SERIES OF PREFERRED STOCK. A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $18.75 PER SHARE WAS DECLARED ON ITS 7.50% NONCUMULATIVE PERPETUAL CONVERTIBLE CLASS A PREFERRED STOCK, SERIES L, LIQUIDATION PREFERENCE $1,000 PER SHARE, WHICH IS TRADED ON THE NEW YORK STOCK EXCHANGE UNDER THE SYMBOL “WFCPRL”. THE SERIES L DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JUNE 15, 2021, TO HOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MAY 28, 2'}{'symbol': 'WYNN', 'date': '2021-05-15 00:04:00-04:56', 'title': 'Wynn Las Vegas Updates Mask Policy to Comply with CDC Guidelines', 'text': 'LAS VEGAS, MAY 14, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BEGINNING THIS EVENING, WYNN LAS VEGAS (NASDAQ: WYNN)\xa0AND ENCORE WILL COMMUNICATE TO GUESTS THAT THEY ARE NOT REQUIRED TO WEAR A MASK IF THEY ARE FULLY VACCINATED AND ARE REQUIRED TO WEAR A MASK IF THEY ARE NOT.\xa0 THE RESORT TRUSTS GUESTS TO TAKE THE APPROPRIATE PRECAUTIONS BASED ON THEIR PERSONAL VACCINATION STATUS.'}